<title>USA: EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</title>
<headline>EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</headline>
<text>
<p>Averages (1,000 bbls/day) for first 114 days of 1997:</p>
<p>---------------------------1997------1996----Pct Chg  Gasoline..................7,627.....7,586......0.5</p>
<p> Distillate Fuel ..........3,581.....3,568......0.4</p>
<p> Residual Fuel...............839.......913.....-8.1</p>
<p> Jet Fuel..................1,576.....1,586.....-0.6</p>
<p> Other Oils................4,502.....4,545.....-0.9</p>
<p> Total Products Supplied..18,124....18,197.....-0.4</p>
<p> Domestic Crude Output.....6,437.....6,511.....-1.1</p>
<p> Crude Imports (Exc SPR)...7,501.....6,957......7.8</p>
<p> Refinery Crude Runs......13,779....13,791.....-0.1</p>
</text>
